<!-- 确认订单（v5「字重」稿 A5）：开进来的小货车 + 地址卡 + 商品卡 + 搭配购（设计稿未画·真实在卖保留）+ 点线明细；
     底部 应付 + 提交（在途换像素 loader）。业务逻辑全在 checkout.ts：地址(onPickAddress)/搭配购(onToggleAddon)/提交(onSubmit)。
     顾客页不展示券类折扣（已拍板·no-customer-coupon-ui 测试钉）。商品数量只读（草稿单源）。 -->
<v5-nav title="确认订单" />

<view class="co">
  <view class="co-truck"><px-truck id="truck" pose="drive" arrive="160" cargo="{{cargo}}" /></view>

  <view class="co-body">
    <!-- 收货地址 -->
    <view wx:if="{{address}}" class="k-card co-card co-addr" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-card-down" bind:tap="onPickAddress">
      <view class="co-addr-top">
        <text class="t-sys co-k">收货地址</text>
        <view class="t-sys co-change"><text>更换</text><px-i name="arrow" /></view>
      </view>
      <view class="co-who">
        <text class="t-sys">{{address.name}}</text>
        <text class="mono co-phone">{{address.phone}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="t-sys co-where">{{address.region}} {{address.detail}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="k-card co-card co-addr-none" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-card-down" bind:tap="onPickAddress">
      <px-i name="led" tone="#f4bd3f" />
      <text class="co-addr-add">添加收货地址</text>
      <px-i name="arrow" tone="#62625c" />
    </view>

    <!-- 商品 -->
    <view class="co-card co-items">
      <view class="co-item" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="lineId">
        <view class="co-thumb">
          <image wx:if="{{item.cover}}" class="co-thumb-img" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        </view>
        <view class="co-item-mid">
          <text class="co-item-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="t-sys co-item-sub">{{item.sku || item.tag}}{{item.sku || item.tag ? ' · ' : ''}}×{{item.qty}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="mono co-item-price">¥{{item.priceNum}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 搭配购买：只有真能卖的加项才露整块；checkoutConst 里 hook/yarn 是占位，空则整块不渲染。 -->
    <view class="co-card co-items" wx:if="{{addons.length}}">
      <text class="t-sys co-k co-addon-head">搭配购买</text>
      <view class="co-item" wx:for="{{addons}}" wx:key="id" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onToggleAddon">
        <view class="k k-sm k-light co-check"><px-i wx:if="{{item.added}}" name="check" tone="#8a5ae0" /></view>
        <text class="co-item-name co-addon-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="mono co-item-price">¥{{item.priceNum}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 金额明细（点线引导）：运费行仍用 shipLabel（SHIP=0 显示「包邮」）；政策说明另起一行，不算钱 -->
    <view class="co-sum">
      <view class="co-sum-row"><text class="t-sys co-k">商品</text><view class="co-leader"></view><text class="mono co-v">{{goodsLabel}}</text></view>
      <view class="co-sum-row"><text class="t-sys co-k">运费</text><view class="co-leader"></view><text class="mono co-v">顺丰速运 · {{shipLabel}}</text></view>
      <text class="t-sys co-policy">包邮到家·售后无忧</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="co-dock-space"></view>
  <view class="co-dock">
    <view class="co-total">
      <text class="t-sys co-k">应付 · 共 {{count}} 件</text>
      <text class="mono co-amount">¥{{amountNum}}</text>
    </view>
    <!-- 在途反馈：像素 loader + 「提交中」（刻意不用 wx.showLoading：本链多分支 return，hideLoading 配对易漏→锁屏） -->
    <view class="k k-ink k-48 co-submit" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="{{submitting ? '' : 'k-ink-down'}}" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onSubmit" data-k="{{submitting ? '' : 'ink'}}" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
      <block wx:if="{{submitting}}"><px-anim name="loader" size="2" dark /><text>提交中</text></block>
      <text wx:else>提交订单</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
